#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""agent-logs — bundle local coding-agent session logs into one shareable zip.

The original transcript files are copied byte-for-byte; nothing is rewritten,
summarised or uploaded. Whoever receives the zip parses it later with
parser/parse_agent_logs.py; running this script needs none of that.

Two agents keep their conversations in SQLite rather than in files (OpenCode,
Cursor). For those the rows are exported to JSONL/JSON inside the zip so that
date filtering and per-session exclusion work the same way everywhere.

macOS, Linux and Windows. Python 3.9+, standard library only.
"""
